# purpose: two accounts interleaved, plus the two rejections that exist at M1.
# exercises: unknown-account on DEPOSIT and BALANCE; account-exists; rejections and
#            queries do not consume a sequence number.
OPEN alice USD
OPEN bob EUR
DEPOSIT alice 10
DEPOSIT bob 20
DEPOSIT carol 5
BALANCE carol
OPEN alice GBP
DEPOSIT alice 1.25
BALANCE alice
BALANCE bob
